# Renewal uses separate environment files for each deployment boundary.
#
# Frontend:
#   copy client/.env.example client/.env
#
# Backend:
#   copy server/.env.example server/.env
#
# Never expose server-only DATABASE_URL, SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY,
# OPENAI_API_KEY, or NCBI_API_KEY through a VITE_* variable.
